  "$\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=\\left(\\dfrac{n+1}{n}\\right)^{{@0}}\\cdot\\dfrac{{@1}}{{@2}}\\to {@3}$. Keďže $q {@4} 1$, rad {@5}.": "$\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=\\left(\\dfrac{n+1}{n}\\right)^{{@0}}\\cdot\\dfrac{{@1}}{{@2}}\\to {@3}$. Como $q {@4} 1$, a série {@5}.",
