  "$\\displaystyle\\int_1^{b}{@0}x^{-{@1}}\\,dx=\\left[-\\frac{{@2}}{{@3}x^{{@4}}}\\right]_1^b=\\frac{{@5}}{{@6}}-\\frac{{@7}}{{@8}b^{{@9}}}\\to\\frac{{@10}}{{@11}}$ pre $b\\to\\infty$. Výsledok: ${@12}$.": "$\\displaystyle\\int_1^{b}{@0}x^{-{@1}}\\,dx=\\left[-\\frac{{@2}}{{@3}x^{{@4}}}\\right]_1^b=\\frac{{@5}}{{@6}}-\\frac{{@7}}{{@8}b^{{@9}}}\\to\\frac{{@10}}{{@11}}$ para $b\\to\\infty$. Resultado: ${@12}$.",
