  "$\\left|\\dfrac{a_n}{a_{n+1}}\\right|=\\dfrac{(2n)!}{(n!)^2}\\cdot\\dfrac{((n+1)!)^2}{(2n+2)!}=\\dfrac{(n+1)^2}{(2n+1)(2n+2)}\\to\\dfrac{1}{4}$. Teda $R=\\frac{1}{4}$.": "$\\left|\\dfrac{a_n}{a_{n+1}}\\right|=\\dfrac{(2n)!}{(n!)^2}\\cdot\\dfrac{((n+1)!)^2}{(2n+2)!}=\\dfrac{(n+1)^2}{(2n+1)(2n+2)}\\to\\dfrac{1}{4}$. Logo, $R=\\frac{1}{4}$.",
