  "$\\ln(1+u)=\\sum\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}u^n}{n}$ s $u={@0}$: koeficient pri $x^{{@1}}$ je $\\frac{(-1)^{{@2}}\\cdot {@3}^{{@4}}}{{@5}}$": "$\\ln(1+u)=\\sum\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}u^n}{n}$ com $u={@0}$: o coeficiente de $x^{{@1}}$ é $\\frac{(-1)^{{@2}}\\cdot {@3}^{{@4}}}{{@5}}$",
  "$\\mathbb{R}^2$ je jednoducho súvislá oblasť, stačí porovnať $\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}={@0}$ a $\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}={@1}$. {@2}": "$\\mathbb{R}^2$ é uma região simplesmente conexa, basta comparar $\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}={@0}$ e $\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}={@1}$. {@2}",
  "$\\mathbf{r}'(t)=(-{@0}\\sin t;\\ {@1}\\cos t;\\ {@2})$, teda $|\\mathbf{r}'(t)|=\\sqrt{{@3}\\sin^2 t+{@4}\\cos^2 t+{@5}}=\\sqrt{{@6}}={@7}$. Dĺžka je $\\int_0^{2\\pi}{@8}\\,dt={@9}\\pi$, koeficient pri $\\pi$ je ${@10}$.": "$\\mathbf{r}'(t)=(-{@0}\\sin t;\\ {@1}\\cos t;\\ {@2})$, logo $|\\mathbf{r}'(t)|=\\sqrt{{@3}\\sin^2 t+{@4}\\cos^2 t+{@5}}=\\sqrt{{@6}}={@7}$. O comprimento é $\\int_0^{2\\pi}{@8}\\,dt={@9}\\pi$; o coeficiente de $\\pi$ é ${@10}$.",
  "$\\mathrm{e}^{u}=\\sum\\frac{u^n}{n!}$ s $u={@0}$: koeficient pri $x^{{@1}}$ je $\\frac{{@2}^{{@3}}}{{@4}!}$": "$\\mathrm{e}^{u}=\\sum\\frac{u^n}{n!}$ com $u={@0}$: o coeficiente de $x^{{@1}}$ é $\\frac{{@2}^{{@3}}}{{@4}!}$",
  "$\\mu={@0}$ (konštantná)": "$\\mu={@0}$ (constante)",
