  "$|z|=\\sqrt{2}$ a $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$, teda $z=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\bigl(\\cos({@1}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@2}^\\circ)\\bigr)$. Podľa Moivreovej vety $z^{{@3}}=(\\sqrt{2})^{{@4}}\\bigl(\\cos({@5}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@6}^\\circ)\\bigr)$, kde $(\\sqrt{2})^{{@7}}={@8}$ a uhol ${@9}^\\circ$ má rovnakú polohu ako ${@10}^\\circ$. Výsledok: $z^{{@11}}={@12}$, odpoveď ${@13};\\ {@14}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{2}$ e $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$, logo $z=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\bigl(\\cos({@1}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@2}^\\circ)\\bigr)$. Pela fórmula de De Moivre, $z^{{@3}}=(\\sqrt{2})^{{@4}}\\bigl(\\cos({@5}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@6}^\\circ)\\bigr)$, em que $(\\sqrt{2})^{{@7}}={@8}$ e o ângulo ${@9}^\\circ$ tem a mesma posição que ${@10}^\\circ$. Resultado: $z^{{@11}}={@12}$, resposta ${@13};\\ {@14}$.",
