  "Vypočítaj $\\left[\\frac{x^{{@0}}}{{@1}}\\ln x\\right]_1^{\\mathrm{e}}$. {@2}": "Calcule $\\left[\\frac{x^{{@0}}}{{@1}}\\ln x\\right]_1^{\\mathrm{e}}$. {@2}",
